= Influence

== What the Recommendation Does

#slide[
  === A negative ISS recommendation sharply lowers support for say-on-pay.
  #inv("T3")

  - When ISS recommends against a say-on-pay proposal, shareholder support for it falls sharply.

  - The paper's sample covers 2011--2019 Russell 3000 meetings.
]

#slide[
  === Firms change their pay plans before the vote, not after it.
  #inv("R4")

  - Within a year of a negative recommendation, 40% of firms amend the plan the advisor criticized.

  - Most amendments land before the next proxy season, so the advisor's next report sees the new plan.
]
